sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Consumer / Field User
    participant App as Sahi Daam Frontend
    participant Session as Session Manager
    participant Quality as Quality & Uncertainty Engine
    participant Market as Multi-Source Market Engine
    participant Valuation as Valuation Engine
    participant Controller as Adaptive Controller
    participant Anomaly as Anomaly & Negotiation Engine

    User->>App: Capture initial image (View 1)
    App->>Session: POST /valuation/session (Image 1, Commodity)
    activate Session
    Session->>Quality: Estimate Quality & Uncertainty (View 1)
    Quality-->>Session: Quality Score, Confidence, Uncertainty_Q1
    Session->>Market: Ingest Evidence (Agmarknet, Nearby, Cache)
    Market-->>Session: Reliability-Weighted Benchmark, Uncertainty_M
    Session->>Valuation: Synthesize Valuation & Propagate Variance
    Valuation-->>Session: Initial Fair Interval [Min, Max], Compound Uncertainty_V1
    Session->>Controller: Evaluate Expected Value of Information (EVI)
    Controller-->>Session: Decision: ACQUIRE_ADDITIONAL_OBSERVATION (EVI > Cost)
    Session-->>App: Session Response (Fair Range, Confidence, Needs View 2, Reason)
    deactivate Session

    App->>User: Display Status: Medium Confidence.<br/>Prompt: "Capture opposite side of produce to inspect hidden surfaces."
    User->>App: Capture second angle (View 2)
    App->>Session: POST /valuation/observe (Session ID, Image 2)
    activate Session
    Session->>Quality: Estimate Quality & Uncertainty (View 2)
    Quality-->>Session: Quality Score, Confidence, Uncertainty_Q2
    Session->>Quality: Multi-Observation Fusion (View 1 + View 2)
    Quality-->>Session: Fused Quality, Retained Defects, Reduced Uncertainty
    Session->>Valuation: Recompute Valuation with Fused Evidence
    Valuation-->>Session: Narrowed Fair Interval [Min', Max'], Reduced Uncertainty_V2
    Session->>Controller: Re-evaluate EVI
    Controller-->>Session: Decision: FINALIZE_VALUATION
    Session-->>App: Updated Valuation (Narrowed Range, High Confidence, Decision Complete)
    deactivate Session

    App->>User: Display Updated Valuation: Range narrowed, High Confidence
    User->>App: Enter Vendor Asking Price
    App->>Anomaly: POST /haggle-check (Asking Price, Fair Range, Confidence)
    Anomaly-->>App: Deal Classification (OVERPRICED / GOOD_DEAL / INSUFFICIENT_CONFIDENCE) + Bargaining Script
    App->>User: Display Multilingual Tactical Negotiation Guidance
